  "prefLabel": "Env-A 806.04 Test Methods for Coal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 806.04 Test Methods for Coal. The owner or operator shall use a test method specified by ASTM that is appropriate for coal to determine the sulfur content of coal in pounds of sulfur per million BTU gross heat content and the mercury content of the coal in parts per million by weight on a dry basis.\n\nSource. #7788, eff 10-31-02; ss by #9802, eff 10-31-10; ss by #12762, eff 5-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a800.html"
